# Data conversion between petabyte and tebibyte

Verifies direct data conversion between petabyte and tebibyte in both directions. Forward, converting 1PB to 909.4947TiB with a fractional coarser-to-finer scale promotes the integer result to decimal, while 1.5PB yields 1364.2420TiB; backward, converting 1TiB to 0.0010PB with a fractional finer-to-coarser scale promotes the integer result to decimal, while 1.5TiB yields 0.0016PB.

>>> source
forward_whole: int = 1PB
print(forward_whole->to(TiB))
forward_fractional: decimal = 1.5PB
print(forward_fractional->to(TiB))
backward_whole: int = 1TiB
print(backward_whole->to(PB))
backward_fractional: decimal = 1.5TiB
print(backward_fractional->to(PB))

<<< stdout
909.4947TiB
1364.2420TiB
0.0010PB
0.0016PB

<<< stderr
